    "titulo": "Leave Me Alone",
    "descricao": "PS1-style slasher horror game inspired by Resident Evil and some horror films from the 80s and 90s.\n\nExplore the hidden terror in the depths of Whispering Woods forest in this slasher game inspired by PS1 classics and horror films from the '80s and '90s. Jackson Foster and Noah Carter's tranquil journey turns into a nightmare as night falls, revealing sinister secrets and a masked killer. Feel the adrenaline as you navigate the dark scenery, immerse yourself in the suspense of a gripping plot, and get ready for moments of pure terror, where the line between legend and reality blurs. Survive the silent trail and unravel the mysteries hidden in the darkness.",
